\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  \cf0 The Church of Christ, however small,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 when people want to destroy you
\par be not afraid or panic
\par They only want you for evil
\par and you may get into troubles
\par but in a moment, it's over.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  The word is from the Lord our God,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 the comforter of all  your souls,
\par He is the only winner,
\par And through the Lord your Saviour
\par shall save your souls from enemies
\par and His word shall reign forever.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  If The Lord God is with His word,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 but even so with death and hell,
\par satan and all his children
\par and all the world shall run away
\par The Lord of Host shall be with us
\par and we shall not be vanquished.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

